입고 → 출고 — single managementId links all processes.

### Slogan

- *"From Receiving to Shipment, One Workflow."*
- *"One Management Number. Complete Traceability."*

---

## QR Policy (Default)

All **internal** print documents include QR automatically.

**Exception:** 거래명세서 — supplier QR only (no internal workflow QR).

### QR Types

| Type | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| **Document QR** | Open document |
| **Management ID QR** | Full workflow for managementId |
| **LOT QR** | Full LOT traceability |

Payload (V1.0): 문서번호 · 관리번호 · 업체명 · 품번 · LOT · 문서종류 · 버전

---

## QR Portal V1.0 (Future Sprint)

QR Scan → TITAN Portal → document info

**Portal shows:** 문서번호 · 관리번호 · 업체 · 품명 · 품번 · LOT · 출력일 · 현재 상태 · 문서 종류

**First screen:** current status + **next required task** + action buttons (role-based)

**Role-based menus:** 생산부 · 품질 · 출하 · 관리자 — different actions from same QR

